  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往阿凯鲁法村（183.104）进入阿凯鲁法城，通过（25.11）处楼梯抵达阿凯鲁法城2楼。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2.前往督府执政官室（42.26），每名队员与罗山督府执政官（16.8）对话，选“是”、“是”，获得【豪华的戒指（伪）】。",
      "type": "per-member-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆若丢弃或损坏【豪华的戒指（伪）】，与罗山督府执政官对话可再次获得",
      "type": "reacquisition-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "3.前往米内葛尔岛（279~337.148~215）处附近击倒随机出现的三种山贼，",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "战斗胜利随机获得【豪华的头巾】、【缓慢的小刀】、【超级内裤】，队伍中一名队员获得一种山贼道具即可。",
      "type": "chance-drop-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◇前往米内葛尔岛（279~337.148~215）路线：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "⑴如果从阿凯鲁法村出发，需经过南恰拉山通道并通过阿德基姆。",
      "type": "route-option",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "通过阿德基姆方法：需要击败阿德基姆，或者队伍中需有队员持有【大地的结晶】。",
      "type": "route-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "⑵如果从坎那贝拉村出发，需经过海峡通道。",
      "type": "route-option",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "备注：【大地的结晶】获得方式和海峡通道开通条件参考《路霸阿德基姆》任务。",
      "type": "route-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆【豪华的戒指（伪）】不一定需要装备，物品栏中存在即可遇到山贼。",
      "type": "held-item-encounter",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "【豪华的戒指（伪）】：Lv.1，戒指，耐久25；攻击+1；不可交易。",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "◆三种【山贼道具】皆为Lv.1护身符；获得任意一种即可，只需一名队员获得即可。",
      "type": "party-item-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◇推荐在米内葛尔岛（280.181）附近遇敌，据说遇敌率高，如图：",
      "type": "encounter-advice",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：（皆为2动）",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "Lv.50山贼杨恰那，武器：剑，血量约3300，邪魔系，属性：水50火50，邪魔系，不抗咒；",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "技能：防御、酒醉攻击、连击、抢钱攻击、逃跑（血量小于25%追加）；",
      "type": "battle-skills",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "掉落【豪华的头巾】（Lv.1、护身符，防御+1，耐久1）",
      "type": "battle-drop",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "Lv.50山贼娜娜尔，武器：小刀，血量约2700，邪魔系，属性：水70地30，邪魔系，不抗咒；",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "技能：攻击、防御、毒性攻击、逃跑（血量小于50%追加）；",
      "type": "battle-skills",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "掉落【缓慢的小刀】（Lv.1、护身符，攻击+20，耐久1）",
      "type": "battle-drop",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "Lv.50山贼伊欧那，武器：杖，血量约2500，邪魔系，属性：地50风50，邪魔系，不抗咒；",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "技能：防御、吸血魔法、强力昏睡魔法、抢钱攻击、逃跑（血量小于25%追加）；",
      "type": "battle-skills",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "掉落【超级内裤】（Lv.1、护身符，防御+75、魅力-50，耐久1）",
      "type": "battle-drop",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "4.前往米内葛尔岛（402.242）处进入街道旁的小路。",
      "type": "boss-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "夜晚，全队持有【豪华的戒指（伪）】（不需装备），队伍中一人装备【山贼道具】的队员与米瓦希米滋（21.14）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "boss-entry-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "（武器皆为 回力镖）",
      "type": "weapon-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "真身（站位中间）：",
      "type": "boss-role-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        29
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "text": "Lv.75伊瓦希米滋，2动，血量约6000~7000，邪魔系，属性：全30，不抗咒；",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        30
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "text": "技能：攻击（我方血少者）、圣盾、阳炎、超强中毒魔法、攻击反弹、",
      "type": "battle-skills",
      "sourceLines": [
        31
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "text": "召唤伊瓦希米兹（分身）*2（仅当场上没有分身时召唤，且为大概率召唤而非100%召唤）",
      "type": "conditional-summon",
      "sourceLines": [
        32
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "text": "召唤的分身：",
      "type": "summon-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        33
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "text": "Lv.75伊瓦希米滋（分身）*2，2动，血量约6000~7000，邪魔系，属性：全30，不抗咒；",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        34
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "text": "技能：攻击（我方血少者）、攻击、阳炎、超强中毒魔法、魔法反弹、自爆（击倒伊瓦希米兹（真身）后追加）",
      "type": "battle-skills",
      "sourceLines": [
        35
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "text": "◇战斗建议：",
      "type": "strategy-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        36
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "text": "自爆的伤害与敌人的血量成正比，一定要削弱分身的血量之后再击倒本体，并且至少留下一个分身。",
      "type": "strategy-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        37
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "text": "建议收宠2动，采取前2后3站位，生存力低的队员站前排。",
      "type": "strategy-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        38
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "text": "在BOSS召唤分身前合击BOSS；召唤分身后，先集中击倒一个分身，之后合击另外一个，",
      "type": "strategy-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        39
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "text": "此时计算好分身的剩余血量（血量有浮动，预留一定的血量），待另一个分身血量消耗到一定程度后开始合击BOSS，击倒BOSS后再合击分身。",
      "type": "strategy-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        40
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "text": "5.战斗胜利后，再与伊瓦希米滋对话，进行选择兰国或者艾尔巴路线。",
      "type": "route-choice",
      "sourceLines": [
        41
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "text": "兰国第八等勋章路线：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        42
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "text": "⑴选“是”获得称号“兰国第八等勋章”、【凯力夏的首饰】，任务完结。",
      "type": "branch-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        43
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "text": "◆如果持有称号“艾尔巴第八~一等勋章”其中任意一种，则会全部消失。",
      "type": "title-exclusivity",
      "sourceLines": [
        44
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "text": "◆凯力夏的首饰：Lv.3、项链、耐久80；攻击力+12~13，防御+5~6；可以交易，不可卖店；无关联任务，可以丢弃。",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        45
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "text": "艾尔巴第八等勋章路线：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        46
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 47,
      "text": "⑴选“否”获得【森之月石】。",
      "type": "branch-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        47
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "text": "⑵返回督府执政官室（42.26），背包留足600G金币空余后，再与罗山督府执政官（16.8）对话，",
      "type": "currency-capacity",
      "sourceLines": [
        48
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "text": "交出【森之月石】，获得称号“艾尔巴第八等勋章”、金币600G、【精灵石的耳环】，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        49
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "text": "◆如果持有的金币过多无法收下，即任务失败。",
      "type": "failure-condition",
      "sourceLines": [
        50
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 51,
      "text": "◆如果持有称号“兰国第八~一等勋章”其中任意一种，则会全部消失。",
      "type": "title-exclusivity",
      "sourceLines": [
        51
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "text": "◆精灵石的耳环：Lv.3、耐久80；攻击力+5~6，防御+12~13；可以交易，不可卖店；无关联任务，可以丢弃。",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        52
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "text": "◆任务完结后，【豪华的戒指（伪）】、【豪华的头巾】、【缓慢的小刀】、【超级内裤】皆可丢弃。",
      "type": "cleanup-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        53
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "text": "◆小贴士：",
      "type": "tips-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        54
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "text": "“兰国第八~一等勋章”、“艾尔巴第八~一等勋章”，2种系列称号只能保留其一，艾尔巴路线较短。",
      "type": "series-exclusivity",
      "sourceLines": [
        55
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "text": "艾尔巴路线最终可获得Lv.1天马或独角兽，兰国路线最终可获得Lv.1镰刀魔或斩首者。",
      "type": "future-series-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        56
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
